OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain will
OL,6,Fgradually spread north through the
OL,7,Fevening and overnight, heaviest and
OL,8,Fmost persistent in the east but a few
OL,9,Fsharp showers for Galloway too.
OL,10,FOccasionally breezy around the North
OL,11,FSea coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FCloudy. Persistent and heavy
OL,14,Frain in the east will gradually ease
OL,15,Fthrough the afternoon. Drier with some
OL,16,Fbrighter weather for Dumfries and
OL,17,FGalloway. Breezy around coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
