OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FFurther
OL,6,Frain or showers at times, occasionally
OL,7,Fheavy, with some drier and brighter
OL,8,Fspells. Winds will be mostly light but
OL,9,Flikely freshening on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
